Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.9 06/21] powerpc/maple: Fix declaration made after definition
Date:   Wed, 15 Apr 2020 07:47:33 -0400
Message-Id: <20200415114748.15713-6-sashal@kernel.org>
